url: 'https://souniolang.org'
abstract: >-
  Sounio is a systems programming language for epistemic computing
  with native uncertainty quantification, GPU acceleration, linear
  types, algebraic effects, and compliance with GUM/ISO 17025
  standards. It provides the Knowledge<T> type for tracking
  measurement uncertainty through computations, compile-time
  dimensional analysis, and a 15M+ term scientific ontology.
keywords:
  - epistemic computing
  - uncertainty quantification
  - scientific computing
  - GPU programming
  - linear types
  - algebraic effects
  - dimensional analysis
  - GUM compliance
  - systems programming
